      <h1>What does the open web <br/>actually <span class="ital">say about you.</span></h1>
      <p class="dek">Paste a domain. 09 teardowns run live in your browser. Page speed against the real Lighthouse numbers, schema, mail authentication, the ads you have running today, the pixels you forgot to remove. One memo. No login.</p>

