  {!memo && (
    <>
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="lbl">What it reads<span class="num">01</span></span>
        <h2>09 dimensions. <span class="ital">Read live, read together.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="sec-body">
        <div class="dim-grid">
          <div class="dim"><div class="dim-head"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20"><use href="#ic-01-diagnostic"/></svg><span class="dim-code">D · 01</span></div><h4>How Google sees you.</h4><p>Sitemap, robots, canonical, schema, og:type. The crawler's view.</p></div>
          <div class="dim"><div class="dim-head"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20"><use href="#ic-03-signal"/></svg><span class="dim-code">D · 02</span></div><h4>How AI engines cite you.</h4><p>/llms.txt, /llms-full.txt, structured data parseable by LLM crawlers.</p></div>
          <div class="dim"><div class="dim-head"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20"><use href="#ic-23-vital"/></svg><span class="dim-code">D · 03</span></div><h4>How fast it loads.</h4><p>Real Lighthouse: LCP, FCP, CLS, INP against Google's good thresholds.</p></div>
          <div class="dim"><div class="dim-head"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20"><use href="#ic-19-numbers"/></svg><span class="dim-code">D · 04</span></div><h4>What you measure.</h4><p>Meta, GA4, GTM, LinkedIn, X, TikTok, Reddit. Including pixels only loaded after JS.</p></div>
          <div class="dim"><div class="dim-head"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20"><use href="#ic-20-share"/></svg><span class="dim-code">D · 05</span></div><h4>Ads running today.</h4><p>Meta, Google, LinkedIn ad libraries. Creative count, platforms, earliest run.</p></div>
          <div class="dim"><div class="dim-head"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20"><use href="#ic-12-confirm"/></svg><span class="dim-code">D · 06</span></div><h4>How visitors convert.</h4><p>Top-1024 CTA, tappable contact, form fields, pricing visibility, social proof.</p></div>
          <div class="dim"><div class="dim-head"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20"><use href="#ic-06-operator"/></svg><span class="dim-code">D · 07</span></div><h4>How it behaves on mobile.</h4><p>Headless render at 390×844. Real scrollWidth, real tap targets, real text size.</p></div>
          <div class="dim"><div class="dim-head"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20"><use href="#ic-14-outreach"/></svg><span class="dim-code">D · 08</span></div><h4>Email reputation.</h4><p>SPF, DMARC, MX. DoH lookups against Cloudflare. Reject, quarantine, missing.</p></div>
